\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f0\fs22\lang9 FDE capstone operating plan\par
Brownfield method: reconstruct evidence and authority first, then architecture, then spec-driven code, then PRD and workbench. The LLM is not the architecture.\par
\par
Do not start with a chatbot\par
The operational problem is not lack of data. Underwriters reconstruct identity, meaning, freshness, policy authority and exceptions by hand. A conversational UI is only a surface over that control plane. Final credit authority stays human.\par
