The ask, stated as a contract\par
Business target\par
Reduce uncomplicated-case TAT to under 30 minutes without weakening policy, tenant isolation, fairness evaluation, human authority, recourse, fallback or audit.\par
\par
Source baseline is 142 minutes. Workshop fixture median 89.5 minutes is a different population \emdash  do not use it as CRD-BR-001 proof.\par
\par
Product boundary\par
SME Credit Underwriting Intelligence Workbench: retrieve, reconcile, explain, draft. AI may not approve, decline, waive policy, merge identity, or invent thresholds.\par
\par
Active authority is CREDIT-POLICY-3.2 plus a human role. Policy PASS is not human APPROVE.\par
