For every material change: name a CRD-FR / CRD-AC \f2\u8594?\f0  /sdd-discover \f2\u8594?\f0  tighten spec if ambiguous \f2\u8594?\f0  /sdd-plan \f2\u8594?\f0  smallest /sdd-implement \f2\u8594?\f0  /sdd-verify \f2\u8594?\f0  evidence/sdd + TRACEABILITY_MATRIX. If stakeholder intent changes, /sdd-change \f1\emdash  do not silently rewrite the spec to match code.\par
\par
Definition of Ready\par
Named CRD ID, source evidence, inspectable AC, listed guardrails, known freshness/conflict behavior, explicit human authority, no blocking OPEN_DECISION, known files and verification.\par
\par
Definition of Done\par
Behavior maps to CRD IDs, scenario evidence exists, hard invariants intact, stale/missing/conflict tested, traces reconstructable, sanity check passes, matrix updated, human review of authority.\par
\par
Never do\par
Invent missing domain facts. Erase stale evidence. Treat model confidence as authority. Put high-impact gates in prompt text only. Clean original fixtures so tests pass. Claim workshop TAT as production proof.\par
